Dispatch all Dodge ships immediately.

76
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:34,160
The honor of the Big
Mom Pirates is at stake.

77
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:40,360
There are three pirate crews
who must face our wrath. First,

78
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,580
