221
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:29,217
Because it ensures that Mama won't
cause any damage to Chocolat Town.

222
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:33,829
All we have to do is give Press a call,
then we can all meet up and stop her.

223
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:44,170
I.

224
00:14:44,253 --> 00:14:46,400
Agree, that is a splendid plan!

225
00:14:49,100 --> 00:14:53,117
Pardon me then please
carry on and good luck.

226
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,580
Thank you oven.

227
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:57,500
I promise we won't let you down.

228
00:14:57,700 --> 00:14:59,280
I don't mean you

229
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:06,040
You're staying here with me stop it

230
