No, how could he do that to his sister?

231
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:13,179
Why would you do such a thing, sir?

232
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:19,300
This matter is none of your concern.

233
00:15:19,540 --> 00:15:21,240
It's a family issue.

234
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:24,137
Hey, let them carry the cake to the porch.

235
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:25,050
Sir!

236
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:28,790
