I didn't come back to give up.

252
00:16:38,620 --> 00:16:43,020
My debt to Nami won't be repaid
until they leave here safely.

253
00:16:44,540 --> 00:16:45,660
Big brother!

254
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:48,420
I can't die till that cake is done!

255
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:49,980
Let me help them!

256
00:16:52,300 --> 00:16:57,580
they saved loneless life i can't
die i have to fight to the end

257
00:17:00,940 --> 00:17:05,377
you're not some teenager going
through a rebellious phase wake up

258
00:17:05,460 --> 00:17:10,060
you're a traitor who tried to
assassinate the leader of our country

259
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:17,940
it brings me no joy to kill
my little sister like this

260
00:17:18,780 --> 00:17:25,337
Then please stop it We need to set an
example for other would-be traitors We have

261
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:30,520
to help her I don't have time to worry
about the consequences But I need an opening

262
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:37,360
Get your hands off her right
now Armin, do you hear me?

263
00:17:37,580 --> 00:17:39,217
He'll save you, sweetie.

264
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:41,500
Hold on! Huh? Who's that guy?

265
00:17:48,820 --> 00:17:49,740
You again?

266
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:52,826
I thought I'd toss your
dumb ass into the sea!

267
00:17:55,420 --> 00:17:56,832
Thanks, whoever you are.

268
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:20,980
Now I just have to get her to safety
before anyone notices I was here.

269
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,860
Time to fly, Shafana. Huh?

270
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:37,540
Time to fly, Shafana.

271
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:45,700
I just knocked over Minister Oven.

272
00:18:45,940 --> 00:18:48,340
Who is Oven and where did he come from?

273
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,820
Yes, I'm pretty strong.

274
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:52,460
I had no idea.

275
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:53,910
Huh?

276
00:18:54,060 --> 00:18:56,117
That obviously wasn't you, dammit!

277
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,660
I'm not at war!

278
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:02,740
Question is, who was it?

279
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:05,000
You saved me.

280
00:19:05,420 --> 00:19:07,596
Sorry I kept you waiting for so long.

281
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:08,760
No, it's fine.

282
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:11,004
Here, Chiffon, head under this.

283
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:16,591
Let's hurry to the shore.

284
00:19:17,780 --> 00:19:18,740
More, more!

285
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:20,972
Clear the way, everyone!

286
00:19:24,660 --> 00:19:26,880
Blackleg rescued me, but...

287
00:19:27,860 --> 00:19:29,380
Hold on...

288
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:33,260
Who in the world was that guy?

289
00:19:33,620 --> 00:19:34,580
It's odd!

290
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:36,030
Ah!

291
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:50,630
There.

292
00:19:52,200 --> 00:19:53,030
Oven!

293
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:54,780
Clever hiding place.

294
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:59,440
That's enough, Oven! Stop it! Rat!

295
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:02,060
We need her, brother.

296
00:20:02,320 --> 00:20:05,097
If we don't have Shipvon's help,
we can't finish Mama's wedding day.

297
00:20:05,180 --> 00:20:07,239
we can't finish Mama's wedding day.

298
00:20:14,020 --> 00:20:16,737
cake just accept your punishment.

299
00:20:16,820 --> 00:20:21,280
I will burn you until nothing remains!

300
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:32,540
What is it?

301
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:35,200
Oven, we found Petchy's ship.

302
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:39,880
It's heading your way now,
straight to Kaku Island.

303
00:20:40,220 --> 00:20:42,357
Our fleet is pursuing them as we speak.

304
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:44,264
We'll drive them into the port.

305
00:20:44,460 --> 00:20:45,460
It can't be.

306
00:20:45,860 --> 00:20:46,780
Petchy, why?

307
00:20:48,660 --> 00:20:52,197
And here I thought your husband
was going to leave you to die.

308
00:20:52,280 --> 00:20:54,751
I guess he's not as heartless as he seems.

309
00:20:55,460 --> 00:20:56,290
Petchy.

310
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:01,380
Hey, Benji!

311
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,260
It's me, Auburn.

312
00:21:06,100 --> 00:21:07,335
Wait, Auburn's there?

313
00:21:07,540 --> 00:21:09,340
I just caught your accomplice,

314
00:21:09,540 --> 00:21:13,900
or rather your dear wife, as she was
about to leave Kaku Island. What?

315
00:21:14,460 --> 00:21:15,290
Little.

316
00:21:15,373 --> 00:21:16,866
Have they captured the madam?

317
00:21:17,980 --> 00:21:21,745
Conveniently, we just left town
and are heading to the port now.

318
00:21:22,180 --> 00:21:24,377
So you just keep sailing straight like you

319
00:21:24,460 --> 00:21:26,757
are already and you can
surrender when you can.

320
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:29,737
Looks like I've been stopped
them before they can take off.

321
00:21:29,820 --> 00:21:32,585
They expected trouble,
but this is a damn mess.

322
00:21:32,740 --> 00:21:36,160
She may be my sister, but I
will kill her on the spot.

323
00:21:37,380 --> 00:21:40,460
So I make extra sure you
don't step out of line.

324
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:43,600
Benji, just ignore him.

325
00:21:43,860 --> 00:21:45,331
Turn around and run away.

326
00:21:46,080 --> 00:21:49,057
I'm the one who decided to
come here in the first place.

327
00:21:49,140 --> 00:21:52,787
If they capture you, they're
still going to execute all of us.

328
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,840
Even if I die, I want you to live.

329
00:21:57,580 --> 00:22:00,000
Mama has hated me for years.

330
00:22:02,540 --> 00:22:04,640
You guys are my real family.

331
00:22:05,700 --> 00:22:08,080
You showed me the meaning of love.

332
00:22:22,820 --> 00:22:28,020
So live on, and someday,
take revenge for me!

333
00:22:29,120 --> 00:22:32,020
As if we could just
leave you and go, Lili!

334
00:22:41,740 --> 00:22:43,620
Stop talking nonsense!

335
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:45,920
Shafan, no!

336
00:22:48,300 --> 00:22:49,440
Fine, Oven.

337
00:22:49,900 --> 00:22:51,959
We'll enter the port like you said.

338
00:22:52,520 --> 00:22:54,297
Hands up, no funny business!

339
00:22:54,380 --> 00:23:01,137
You got my boy, but you keep
your dirty little mitts off.

340
00:23:01,220 --> 00:23:02,417
As your fun capisce

341
00:23:02,500 --> 00:23:09,277
very well then,

342
00:23:09,360 --> 00:23:11,877
who knew you were such a softy?

343
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:14,257
This is gonna cost you your neck!

344
00:23:14,340 --> 00:23:16,222
You really should have run away.

345
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:20,100
Banshee's ship is pulling in!

346
00:23:20,560 --> 00:23:23,620
All soldiers, prepare to fire on command!

347
00:23:26,360 --> 00:23:30,595
Tarts, separate into right and left
flanks and block their escape route!

348
00:23:31,080 --> 00:23:31,910
Sir!

349
00:23:39,860 --> 00:23:42,480
Well, I'll be damned, there he is.

350
00:23:42,660 --> 00:23:43,517
That was easy.

351
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:46,365
So he's surrendering
without a fight after all.

352
00:23:46,760 --> 00:23:49,642
Minister Evans' carriage
is arriving at the port.

353
00:23:50,780 --> 00:23:52,300
It's Straw Hat!

354
00:23:53,160 --> 00:23:55,180
What the hell? And Barrel.

355
00:23:55,360 --> 00:23:56,900
Help me, Amand, please!

356
00:23:57,740 --> 00:23:58,570
Huh?

357
00:23:58,653 --> 00:24:00,260
Is that guy over there Straw Hat?

358
00:24:00,520 --> 00:24:01,900
What is he doing here?

359
00:24:02,740 --> 00:24:03,570
Mama!

360
00:24:03,653 --> 00:24:04,483
You see that?

361
00:24:04,620 --> 00:24:06,914
It seems Straw Hat showed up after all!

362
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:08,920
And he must have my case!

363
00:24:09,300 --> 00:24:11,417
He thought Big Mom was chasing the Sunny!

364
00:24:11,500 --> 00:24:12,417
What gives, Bridge?

365
00:24:12,500 --> 00:24:14,697
Did this situation make any sense to you?

366
00:24:14,780 --> 00:24:16,700
Please rescue me, Mama!

367
00:24:34,840 --> 00:24:35,670
Mama!

368
00:24:39,800 --> 00:24:41,480
Oh, crap!

369
00:24:41,800 --> 00:24:42,920
She's after me!

370
00:24:43,280 --> 00:24:48,160
Well, star hat, where
are you hiding my cake?

371
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:50,700
I don't know, but it's not here!

372
00:24:51,180 --> 00:24:54,020
Mama, Press, anyone help?

373
00:24:54,280 --> 00:24:55,800
Release my sister!

374
00:24:56,960 --> 00:24:58,540
Dandy Wolf!

375
00:25:04,700 --> 00:25:07,300
Right, it's time for third gear!

376
00:25:12,140 --> 00:25:14,140
All right, Kum Kum!

377
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:16,740
Giant pistol!

378
00:25:22,980 --> 00:25:25,900
No use, I can't break it without my Haki!

379
00:25:27,260 --> 00:25:28,800
There's no escape.

380
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,720
It's surrounding us!

381
00:25:40,160 --> 00:25:41,560
Slow walks.

382
00:25:43,260 --> 00:25:44,090
Yikes!

383
00:25:44,900 --> 00:25:48,312
I know you're trying to help,
but please don't cut me too!

384
00:25:49,620 --> 00:25:55,360
My famed Blade Shit longs to deliver
a painful, lingering death to you.

385
00:25:55,900 --> 00:25:58,617
I hate to run, but I can't
fight you guys right now!

386
00:25:58,700 --> 00:25:59,530
No!

387
00:26:10,060 --> 00:26:11,880
Gotta find a mirror! Quick!

388
00:26:13,220 --> 00:26:15,000
This is a problem, Pedos.

389
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,960
Your wall is in my way.

390
00:26:18,740 --> 00:26:19,780
Candy Slug!

391
00:26:29,060 --> 00:26:31,180
Give me my cake!

392
00:26:31,860 --> 00:26:37,580
I just have to keep running
till I get my Haki back!

393
00:26:45,280 --> 00:26:47,800
Give me my cake!

394
00:26:49,980 --> 00:26:50,810
I'll help!

395
00:26:55,900 --> 00:26:57,580
Heros, please stop her.

396
00:26:57,800 --> 00:26:59,080
This is my city.

397
00:26:59,380 --> 00:27:03,220
I know you want to kill Straw
Hat, but focus your destruction!

398
00:27:04,680 --> 00:27:07,560
You can't escape, Straw Hat!

399
00:27:07,900 --> 00:27:09,520
Do you hear me?

400
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:23,340
Damn it!

401
00:27:23,600 --> 00:27:25,718
The whole town is reduced to rubble!

402
00:27:34,300 --> 00:27:35,700
Where is Straw Hat?

403
00:27:36,020 --> 00:27:36,940
He's gone.

404
00:27:39,020 --> 00:27:40,920
Man, was that close or what?

405
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:44,270
Hold on.

406
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:46,337
Maybe it's good that Big Mom is here.

407
00:27:46,420 --> 00:27:51,008
Not good for me so much, but it means
the others must have gotten away safely.

408
00:27:57,880 --> 00:27:58,710
Ships!

409
00:27:58,793 --> 00:28:00,060
I see the enemy!

410
00:28:00,360 --> 00:28:02,377
The Big Mom Pirates are catching up!

411
00:28:02,460 --> 00:28:05,040
Understood. You ready? Yes.

412
00:28:05,360 --> 00:28:07,497
All this running around was getting dull.

413
00:28:07,580 --> 00:28:09,460
I say we fight. Yeah!

414
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:10,680
Leave it to us!

415
00:28:10,920 --> 00:28:12,340
Let's do this, Carrot!

416
00:28:14,800 --> 00:28:15,900
Are you there?

417
00:28:31,820 --> 00:28:32,660
Hello?

418
00:28:33,340 --> 00:28:34,180
Carrot!

419
00:28:34,480 --> 00:28:35,320
Hey!

420
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:38,052
We got a big battle coming, so get ready!

421
00:28:39,160 --> 00:28:39,990
The sky.

422
00:28:40,320 --> 00:28:41,150
Look.

423
00:28:41,620 --> 00:28:42,450
Huh?

424
00:28:45,760 --> 00:28:49,240
Is tonight gonna be a full moon?

425
00:28:50,060 --> 00:28:50,890
Huh?

426
00:29:12,520 --> 00:29:14,160
Mr. Ruppet!

427
00:29:20,800 --> 00:29:21,760
Mr. Ruppet!

428
00:29:39,800 --> 00:29:40,860
Those idiots.

429
00:29:41,860 --> 00:29:44,500
That was smooth as hell, father!

430
00:29:47,900 --> 00:29:50,520
Remember this, Pez. Watch close.

431
00:29:52,840 --> 00:29:54,517
This is how I roll.

432
00:29:54,600 --> 00:29:58,100
It's your papa's way of life. Yes!

433
00:30:06,900 --> 00:30:08,740
Nice work, Veggie.

434
00:30:09,080 --> 00:30:11,660
Whatever you do next, we've got your back.

435
00:30:21,080 --> 00:30:22,520
Straw Hat is here.

436
00:30:22,660 --> 00:30:23,957
Someone please help me!

437
00:30:24,040 --> 00:30:26,400
Would you shut up, Branch? It's Barrel.

438
00:30:26,860 --> 00:30:28,036
This is Chip's Town.

439
00:30:28,260 --> 00:30:30,966
Straw Hat Luffy has been
sighted in this area.

440
00:30:31,980 --> 00:30:33,100
Let me go.

441
00:30:35,380 --> 00:30:37,060
This is Chock Full Town.

442
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:40,440
Straw Hat has been sighted. What?

443
00:30:40,580 --> 00:30:42,180
He was just in Chip's Town.

444
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:44,500
He's popping up all over the place.

445
00:30:44,780 --> 00:30:47,251
He must be running through the Miro World.

446
00:30:47,680 --> 00:30:49,400
Oh, come on, Barrel.

447
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:51,602
Did you really get caught again?

448
00:30:52,520 --> 00:30:53,579
This is Greentown!

449
00:30:54,380 --> 00:30:58,177
We have multiple calls from citizens
reporting that they saw someone suspicious!

450
00:30:58,260 --> 00:30:59,680
It could be Straw Hat!

451
00:31:07,740 --> 00:31:09,760
What are you trying to pull here?

452
00:31:10,140 --> 00:31:13,540
If you want to escape, then
just go to Cacao Island. Huh?

453
00:31:13,760 --> 00:31:15,497
How do you know about our plan?

454
00:31:15,580 --> 00:31:17,260
I was eavesdropping on you.

455
00:31:17,560 --> 00:31:18,940
Now everybody knows.

456
00:31:19,620 --> 00:31:20,777
Are you kidding me?

457
00:31:20,860 --> 00:31:22,160
Just give it up.

458
00:31:22,340 --> 00:31:24,987
There's no way you'll
ever defeat my brother.

459
00:31:31,600 --> 00:31:33,320
Haki doesn't last forever.

460
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:42,880
If the fight goes on long enough, his
observation powers will get weaker.

461
00:31:43,080 --> 00:31:43,980
I'm sure of it.

462
00:31:45,140 --> 00:31:46,397
Wee, wee, wee, wee.

463
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:50,715
You look like a dope, but you're
pretty sharp when it comes to fighting.

464
00:31:50,860 --> 00:31:52,900
I still need something more.

465
00:31:56,600 --> 00:31:57,430
Luffy,

466
00:31:57,513 --> 00:31:59,720
I gave you the best lessons I could,

467
00:31:59,980 --> 00:32:03,098
but Haki becomes much stronger
in the heat of battle.

468
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:04,828
That will be the true test.

469
00:32:05,900 --> 00:32:11,140
And the stronger the enemies you face,
the faster your own strength will evolve.

470
00:32:15,600 --> 00:32:17,860
I wonder if I could see the future.

471
00:32:18,380 --> 00:32:19,657
Even just a little.

472
00:32:19,740 --> 00:32:21,900
What are you talking about?

473
00:32:22,160 --> 00:32:24,513
Don't push your luck, you little shrimp.

474
00:32:36,620 --> 00:32:38,680
I want to surpass him.

475
00:32:50,840 --> 00:32:53,780
I want to fight him at his full strength,

476
00:32:54,020 --> 00:32:59,720
and then I'll defeat him,
the Billionberry Man.
